d digging tool?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"Branch press at intensity 0.25 held at tick 12; intensity 0.5 did not hold at tick 18.\\\",\\\"Studied the wooden digging-tool method by tick 23.\\\",\\\"Inspection at tick 24 found sound unworked branch stock, no visible split, and dimensions allowing a taper with a retained shaft.\\\",\\\"Direct observation at tick 31 confirmed the nearby weathered stone and its current stock of 7.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"The stone's abrasive performance, actual shaping progress, and the resulting tool's soil-moving performance remain untested.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Make and physically test one tool with conservative loading, recording failures as well as successes.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Completed two branch press trials and shared the low-load result and water-access limitation with Sol.\\\",\\\"Completed study of the wooden digging-tool method.\\\",\\\"Inspected the branch and approached and observed the weathered stone.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"Recorded branch load-response observations and branch inspection.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"Successful shaping, identified released tool, and direct soil-use evidence.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Recover energy and attempt one shaping segment; inspect its returned progress and work identity before continuing.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"The inspections establish a concrete candidate piece and reachable trial surface without claiming that a tool already exists.\\\"}],\\\"cares\\\":null,\\\"views\\\":{}}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"001105f5-1213-480c-9a5b-d960696943df","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxIt